X-WR-CALNAME:Hammersmith & City disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-26T04:30:00&endDate=2026-12-30T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nHAMMERSMITH & CITY LINE: Boxing Day\, 26 December to Tuesday 29 December\, no service between Moorgate and Barking. There will also be no DISTRICT LINE service between East Ham and Barking / Upney. c2c services will not operate on Boxing Day but operate between Fenchurch Street\, Limehouse\, West Ham\, Barking and Upminster on other days (no trains to/from Liverpool Street). Replacement bus service DL7 operates between East Ham\, Barking and Upney.
DTEND:20261230T012900Z
DTSTART:20261226T043000Z
SUMMARY:Hammersmith & City: Part Closure
UID:13482eef-f4aa-46b3-a54a-f3da3225f8fd@1348.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-26T10:00:00&endDate=2026-11-27T18:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning to take strike action from 1200 Thursday 26 until 1159 Friday 27 November. A normal service is expected until 1000 Thursday when services will begin to reduce. From 1200\, there will be disruption on all lines and no service is expected after 2100. No trains will run all day Thursday and until 1200 Friday on the Circle and Piccadilly lines\, or on the Waterloo & City line between 1200 Thursday and 1200 Friday. Disruption will continue between 1200 and 1800 Friday\, with a normal service expected after then
DTEND:20261127T180000Z
DTSTART:20261126T100000Z
SUMMARY:Hammersmith & City: Reduced Service
UID:e009799f-4161-47bd-b775-edde0223bb54@e009.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-11-28T04:30:00&endDate=2026-11-30T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nHAMMERSMITH & CITY LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 November\, no service on the entire line. There will also be no CIRCLE LINE service between Hammersmith / High Street Kensington and Tower Hill (via Kings Cross St Pancras). Use DISTRICT LINE services between Aldgate East and Barking.
DTEND:20261130T012900Z
DTSTART:20261128T043000Z
SUMMARY:Hammersmith & City: Planned Closure
UID:011957f3-6017-477a-ac92-d24fb3d6951f@0119.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2027-01-04T12:00:00&endDate=2027-01-05T11:59:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning to take strike action from 12:00 Monday 4 until 11:59 Tuesday 5 January. There is likely to be some disruption across all Underground lines\, but trains are expected to run on most lines.
DTEND:20270105T115900Z
DTSTART:20270104T120000Z
SUMMARY:Hammersmith & City: Special Service
UID:b22f17ab-f0a1-4e31-9942-ba435d3a3d70@b22f.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-25T01:30:00&endDate=2026-12-26T04:30:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nLONDON UNDERGROUND: Christmas Day\, 25 December\, no service on any line. Services resume on Boxing Day morning to a revised Sunday timetable. No Night Tube services operate on Christmas Eve or Boxing Day.
DTEND:20261226T043000Z
DTSTART:20261225T013000Z
SUMMARY:Hammersmith & City: Planned Closure
